<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-include path="./common/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#FDFDFD">
    <mj-include path="./common/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="20px">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          color="#444"
          font-size="32px"
          font-family="Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
          padding="10px 30px"
          ><strong>Your sponsorship is approved</strong></mj-text
        >
        <mj-text
          color="#444"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          font-family="Inter,Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
          padding="10px 30px"
        >
          Hi [[applicantName]],<br /><br />
          Good news! [[organizationName]] now has the full Cloud plan for free,
          storage and AI credits included. It's already active.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          color="#444"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          font-family="Inter,Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
          padding="10px 30px"
        >
          <strong>What's included</strong>
          <ul style="margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px">
            <li>The Cloud plan, free for 12 months</li>
            <li>
              A short check-in after 12 months. If you're still under 50 people
              and using it, we'll renew.
            </li>
            <li>
              If you grow beyond 50, we'll talk together about what's fair. You
              won't be cut off suddenly.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          color="#444"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          font-family="Inter,Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
          padding="10px 30px"
        >
          <strong>What we'd ask in return</strong>
          <ul style="margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px">
            <li>A short call after 1-2 months to hear how it's going</li>
            <li>Let us know when you hit problems</li>
            <li>
              Permission to mention your church on the TheOpenPresenter website
            </li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          color="#444"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          font-family="Inter,Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
          padding="10px 30px"
        >
          <strong>Only if you're happy to</strong>
          <span style="color: #888">(optional)</span>
          <ul style="margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px">
            <li>
              A sentence or two about your experience later on. We can write it
              for you to approve
            </li>
            <li>A photo of TheOpenPresenter in use that we could share</li>
            <li>Mentioning it to other small churches you know</li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          color="#444"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          font-family="Inter,Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
          padding="10px 30px"
        >
          Thank you for reaching out. We're glad to support what you're doing.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px 0">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-button
          mj-class="text"
          background-color="#38A169"
          color="#FFF"
          font-weight="bold"
          border="none"
          padding="0px 30px"
          border-radius="5px"
          href="[[link]]"
          font-family="Inter, Helvetica"
          padding-bottom="20px"
          >View your plan</mj-button
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="./common/footer_transactional.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
